    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners de Courcy O Dwyer are delighted to offer for sale No. 24 Clonile on the Old Cratloe Road, Caherdavin, Limerick, this five bedroomed semi detached residence which is presented in show house condition and located in this highly sought after suburb of Caherdavin. \r\n\r\nThis property was completely refurbished in 2024 with massive emphasis on the plumbing, electrics, insulation along with new bathrooms, floorings etc. The house boasts an A3 BER rating therefore qualifying for a green mortgage from all the leading lenders. The property is located close to a host of amenities to include schools, shops and colleges, shopping centres and located within easy access to the N18, M20 and M7 road networks allowing quick access to Limerick city, Shannon airport and all other major cities.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, sun lounge, guest w. c., five bedrooms main ensuite and bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is serviced with gas fired central heating (new boiler c. 2025) underfloor heating, solar panels and a west facing rear garden.\r\nA viewing of this property is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nNavy composite entrance door. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - \r\nLaminate flooring. TV point. Wall paneling.\r\n\r\nFamily Room / Bedroom 5 - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - \r\nModern fitted kitchen with array of eye and floor level units. Double doors to sun lounge. Breakfast counter.  Porcelain tiled floor. \r\n\r\nUtility Room - \r\nPlumbed for washing machine.  Porcelain tiled floor. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nSun Lounge - \r\nComposite floor.\r\n\r\nGuest W. C. - \r\nW. C. Wash hand basin in vanity unit. Porcelain tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\nLanding. Hot press with dual immersion.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - \r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - \r\nW.C. Wash hand basin. Shower with electric shower. Part tiled walls. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - \r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - \r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - \r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nShower cubicle with electric shower and glass shower door. W.C. W.H.B. in vanity unit. Fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Semi detached\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nTriple glazed windows\r\nFive bedrooms\r\nNew kitchen / bathrooms\r\n19 solar panels\r\nBuilt in 1999 - complete renovation in 2024\r\nLocated in a quiet cul de sac\r\nWithin walking distance of TUS, Jetland Shopping Centre, primary and secondary schools and a host of amenities"
      },
